# Topic 5 — Cell Formats

## Objective

Practice Excel cell formatting using a Pinterest Analytics dataset.

## Skills Practiced

- Date formatting
- Number formatting
- Decimal places
- Percentage formatting
- Currency formatting
- Text formatting
- Date and time formatting
- Format Cells dialog
- Understanding how Excel displays underlying values

## Dataset

The dataset contains Pinterest performance information:

- Date
- Pin Title
- Category
- Impressions
- Engagements
- Saves
- Outbound Clicks
- CTR
- Affiliate Revenue

## Formatting Applied

| Data | Format |
|---|---|
| Date | dd-mm-yyyy |
| Impressions | Number, 0 decimals |
| Engagements | Number, 0 decimals |
| Saves | Number, 0 decimals |
| Outbound Clicks | Number, 0 decimals |
| CTR | Percentage, 2 decimals |
| Affiliate Revenue | Indian Rupee currency |

## Key Learning

Cell formatting changes how data is displayed without necessarily changing the underlying value.

Correct formatting improves readability and helps communicate analytical results accurately.

## Practical Application

These formatting skills will be used in later Excel exercises involving calculations, functions, analysis, and dashboards.

## File

`Pinterest_Cell_Formats_Practice.xlsx`